CMAK 

Note : Execute below commands as a root. 
Java version should be 11+

git clone https://github.com/yahoo/CMAK.git

cd CMAK 

./sbt clean dist      ——> it will take some time. 


cd taget/universal/       —> untar the cmak file —> get inside the cmak folder —> cd conf/ —> open application.conf —> need to change cmak.zkhosts="enter zookeeper:2181" 


After the change in application.conf file will run the below commands . 

Note : Before running below command , make sure your zookeeper and broker are in running state . 

bin/cmak -Dconfig.file=conf/application.conf -Dhttp.port=8080     —— port can be any port of your choice 